        "title": "CoreWeave surges, but bigger tests loom for the AI trade",
        "description": "<p>CoreWeave (<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"\" class=\"link\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/CRWV/\" data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\">CRWV</a>) jumped 24% in morning trading as the company <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"\" class=\"link\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/markets/stocks/article/coreweave-stock-pops-as-q3-revenue-beats-estimates-company-raises-full-year-outlook-211533280.html\" data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\">beat on third quarter sales estimates</a>. The rally offers a much-needed boost to AI investors, but bigger tests lie ahead, with Nvidia  (<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"\" class=\"link\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/NVDA/\" data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\">NVDA</a>) earnings next week and Anthropic (<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"\" class=\"link\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/ANTH.PVT/\" data-i13n=\"cpos:4;pos:1\">ANTH.PVT</a>) preparing for a potential IPO. Host Kevin Kelly, Kelly Intelligence Founder, CEO, and CCO, and his panel of experts weigh in.<br><br>Today's panel includes EP Wealth Advisors Managing Director of Investments Adam Phillips, Zacks Investment Management Chief Market Strategist Brian Mulberry, and ProShares Global Investment Strategist Simeon Hyman.</p>",
